        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrandMa Studios invites you to experience the terrifying investigation that started The Unseen Fears series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old friend has called you in to help investigate a string of recent murders. The latest victim was only missing one thing…their skin. As you start investigating, you're quickly thrown into a world of dark magic and creatures. Do you have what it takes to find the murderer in time, or will you be their next victim? Find out in this bone-chilling Hidden-Object Puzzle adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won't find in the standard version. The Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tSave Sorrel’s family from the Hunters in the bonus game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tReplay your favorite mini-games and HOPs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tEarn achievements and hunt for hidden collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tEnjoy concept art, wallpapers, screensavers, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game - a sub genre of point &amp; click adventure. Follow protagonists on a story-driven quest, find cleverly hidden objects, and solve various puzzles to advance the plot.</p>",
